{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-pad","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-pad-omniyat-business-bay","about":"The Pad - a premium project by developer Omniyat, located in the Business Bay business district. The architectural feature of the building is a 7 degree inclination level and a glossy glass façade that is illuminated by led lights at night. The colour intensity of the lighting depends on the time of day and air temperature.Residents of the complex can find a lot of activities for their interests. There is an equipped gym, swimming pool with sun loungers, spa, sauna, children's playground, as well as a complex recreation area and a green landscaped garden with recreational areas and jogging and walking paths. There are concierge services and 24-hour security with CCTV on site, and cafes, restaurants and retail outlets within walking distance.The Pad is located on the banks of Dubai Creek canal, on the border of Dubai's most prestigious neighbourhoods - Business Bay and Downtown Dubai. Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are just 10 minutes away, Dubai International Airport is 15 minutes away and Burj Al Arab, Palm Jumeirah and Dubai Marina are all within a 25-minute drive.Fully furnished luxury apartments with 1-2 bedrooms are available for sale. Each residence features a comfortable layout with spacious rooms and high quality finishes, while panoramic windows offer stunning views of the Burj Khalifa and Dubai Canal.","price":1763000,"title":"The Pad","bitrix":{"id":471,"pf_id":"are.2.2446","source":null,"project_id":"The Pad","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Pad","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Omniyat","project_location":"Business Bay"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/352/images/2023/08/09/340x252/GfPsaFVcmeHTyO1Qe4B43BHq3fzlOmO9vAB96fpq.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/352/ima